ily's teenage son, Aigin, observes the slaughter. He manages to flee from these killers and reaches a camp with other Sámi whose inhabitants are worried if he has been able to hide his track. Afraid of the murderous people, they decide to flee to the coast. The boy stays alone to avenge his family's murder. Unfortunately, they get him before he can do anything and force him to lead them to the other Sámi. He guides them but has a plan to destroy the barbarous people before reaching the camp.","tagline":"When the invader comes...the hardest path to find is survival."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kH1PdRP0oWkWKZgkTl4sryUQ1YI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bWoGpYfhHjod5795MpFgH8zMoFj.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":2172,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"se-SE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kH1PdRP0oWkWKZgkTl4sryUQ1YI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kH1PdRP0oWkWKZgkTl4sryUQ1YI.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kH1PdRP0oWkWKZgkTl4sryUQ1YI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kH1PdRP0oWkWKZgkTl4sryUQ1YI.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cpJvdyNZaD3j2DUHO10Xa7vG8rJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cpJvdyNZaD3j2DUHO10Xa7vG8rJ.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cpJvdyNZaD3j2DUHO10Xa7vG8rJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cpJvdyNZaD3j2DUHO10Xa7vG8rJ.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aDYe7oRs6q5Yj4zV1OS3ar4z